(7412946, 1168704, 38032, '<td valign="top">You''ve made me want to know more. The image is great although I find myself wanting to rotate it slightly CCW.<br/> and I also wish i could get a better view of this person. It in my top few for sure - Personally, I would not title it the same way but that''s me - I''d try to let the image say that what it needs to say. 7</td>', 'You''ve made me want to know more. The image is great although I find myself wanting to rotate it slightly CCW. and I also wish i could get a better view of this person. It in my top few for sure - Personally, I would not title it the same way but that''s me - I''d try to let the image say that what it needs to say. 7', '2015-10-28 22:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412947, 1168522, 38032, '<td valign="top">Some really interesting things to see here. The feet on the left are a great balance and a bit of mystery. I feel like the crowd at the right is extraneous and distracts from the creepy vibe. I''m not much for crowds ;) 7</td>', 'Some really interesting things to see here. The feet on the left are a great balance and a bit of mystery. I feel like the crowd at the right is extraneous and distracts from the creepy vibe. I''m not much for crowds ;) 7', '2015-10-28 22:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
