(7412954, 1168556, 30214, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the strong diagonal. Great shot, definitely has the vibe</td>', 'I love the colors and the strong diagonal. Great shot, definitely has the vibe', '2015-10-28 22:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412955, 1168376, 30214, '<td valign="top">hmm, not sure why you chose to take this photo. Nothing draws my attention, except perhaps the bus number 0905 which is similar to the number of your photos 0804 :).</td>', 'hmm, not sure why you chose to take this photo. Nothing draws my attention, except perhaps the bus number 0905 which is similar to the number of your photos 0804 :).', '2015-10-28 22:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412956, 1168735, 30214, '<td valign="top">cute! I like the BW conversion and the title</td>', 'cute! I like the BW conversion and the title', '2015-10-28 22:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412958, 1168787, 38032, '<td valign="top">The title is a clever combination of the signs but takes a tad of ambiguity out of it al for me. The snap-shot fell combined with an exquisite composition works well here. Bumping to 7.</td>', 'The title is a clever combination of the signs but takes a tad of ambiguity out of it al for me. The snap-shot fell combined with an exquisite composition works well here. Bumping to 7.', '2015-10-28 22:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412959, 1168762, 30214, '<td valign="top">Wow, the guy taking selfie, looks very much like the guy in the poster! And the woman also is rather similar to the cabaret dancer. Nice catch! Looks to me like a signature <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=124815" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Mariuca</a> shot :)</td>', 'Wow, the guy taking selfie, looks very much like the guy in the poster! And the woman also is rather similar to the cabaret dancer. Nice catch! Looks to me like a signature  Mariuca shot :)', '2015-10-28 22:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412960, 1168505, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice catch!</td>', 'nice catch!', '2015-10-28 22:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413002, 1168778, 38032, '<td valign="top">This may not be a quintessential "street" photo but it certainly is uplifting! Atypical of what we usually see in this sort of genre. Well done 8</td>', 'This may not be a quintessential "street" photo but it certainly is uplifting! Atypical of what we usually see in this sort of genre. Well done 8', '2015-10-29 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413005, 1168762, 124815, '<td valign="top">I love taking photos of people looking at art or just beeing in museums but this one does not appeal to me that much: the pronounced sepia applied, the sharpening, the insistent dodging, too much floor space... There is this gut feeling sometimes that we have, beyond explanations.<br/>I marked it with 6</td>', 'I love taking photos of people looking at art or just beeing in museums but this one does not appeal to me that much: the pronounced sepia applied, the sharpening, the insistent dodging, too much floor space... There is this gut feeling sometimes that we have, beyond explanations.I marked it with 6', '2015-10-29 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413007, 1168760, 124815, '<td valign="top">Aren''t they selling something? Just curiosity.<br/>Nice capture<br/>Bump</td>', 'Aren''t they selling something? Just curiosity.Nice captureBump', '2015-10-29 10:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413026, 1168674, 124815, '<td valign="top">Terrific and terrifying place. What a nightmare! The floor is amazing; all these people walking on water. As a photo, I think that you tried to show too much detail.<br/>bump one up</td>', 'Terrific and terrifying place. What a nightmare! The floor is amazing; all these people walking on water. As a photo, I think that you tried to show too much detail.bump one up', '2015-10-29 13:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413027, 1168798, 124815, '<td valign="top">Truly, this is legoland! The composition and geometry is wonderful. I would have tried it in B&amp;W. As it is, a crispier look would have been even better - I am talking about the yellowish hue on the top part of the image that takes some of the automatic feeling away.<br/>voted earlier</td>', 'Truly, this is legoland! The composition and geometry is wonderful. I would have tried it in B&W. As it is, a crispier look would have been even better - I am talking about the yellowish hue on the top part of the image that takes some of the automatic feeling away.voted earlier', '2015-10-29 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413033, 1168675, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines on this street that lead to the ''horizon'' of this cityscape. The B&amp;W dynamic tones are excellent and call attention to all the details of this busy city scene without full color to distract. The brick paved road is the pathway that pedestrians, cars and bicyclists use each and every day. Great capture of a moment of every day city life with the main subject of man on the bike bringing home groceries/merchandise from his day of shopping.</td>', 'Great leading lines on this street that lead to the ''horizon'' of this cityscape. The B&W dynamic tones are excellent and call attention to all the details of this busy city scene without full color to distract. The brick paved road is the pathway that pedestrians, cars and bicyclists use each and every day. Great capture of a moment of every day city life with the main subject of man on the bike bringing home groceries/merchandise from his day of shopping.', '2015-10-29 16:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413050, 1168535, 18367, '<td valign="top">We all have our preferences and differing views on things.<br/> <br/>While I do like the image, I personally would have cropped the male completely out of the picture as I find his presence distracting.<br/> <br/>Gave the image a 7 nonetheless.</td>', 'We all have our preferences and differing views on things. While I do like the image, I personally would have cropped the male completely out of the picture as I find his presence distracting. Gave the image a 7 nonetheless.', '2015-10-29 19:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413051, 1168845, 18367, '<td valign="top">I earnestly believe that this image will end up on the front page of the challenge.<br/> <br/>I would have cropped both extremities of the photo since in my humble opinion they detract from the overall quality of the photo.<br/> <br/>Very nicely done and in my view definitely worth an 8.</td>', 'I earnestly believe that this image will end up on the front page of the challenge. I would have cropped both extremities of the photo since in my humble opinion they detract from the overall quality of the photo. Very nicely done and in my view definitely worth an 8.', '2015-10-29 20:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413121, 1168760, 43463, '<td valign="top">Doing homework on a desk at night out on the city sidewalk is an unusual sight, but given the sign nearby I am guessing this is a tutoring business mayhap? It is an interesting moment to capture showing this young girl doing homework with an older woman sitting by her side to assist with any questions. A desk lamp sits nearby to provide the needed light to illuminate the books and I love how the little dog sitting under the table is keeping watch out for any people who would pass by disturbing the concentration of the student studying. Great capture and love the B&amp;W processing with wonderful tonal range that really sets off all the details in this shot.</td>', 'Doing homework on a desk at night out on the city sidewalk is an unusual sight, but given the sign nearby I am guessing this is a tutoring business mayhap? It is an interesting moment to capture showing this young girl doing homework with an older woman sitting by her side to assist with any questions. A desk lamp sits nearby to provide the needed light to illuminate the books and I love how the little dog sitting under the table is keeping watch out for any people who would pass by disturbing the concentration of the student studying. Great capture and love the B&W processing with wonderful tonal range that really sets off all the details in this shot.', '2015-10-30 08:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413124, 1168522, 43463, '<td valign="top">Just an everyday street scene as we walk along tending to our business until one spots the one thing that instantly makes one uncomfortable. The man in the white shirt leans/points at the column and looks over his shoulder back at us with a menacing stare. It makes one feel like they stumbled into an area they are not welcome - we have walked into his personal space; we are the intruders and he does not want us here. The question to the viewer is what course of action should one take: give a friendly greeting while walking by or give this man a wide berth avoiding any further contact. A good capture that invokes thought and emotional response in your viewers.</td>', 'Just an everyday street scene as we walk along tending to our business until one spots the one thing that instantly makes one uncomfortable. The man in the white shirt leans/points at the column and looks over his shoulder back at us with a menacing stare. It makes one feel like they stumbled into an area they are not welcome - we have walked into his personal space; we are the intruders and he does not want us here. The question to the viewer is what course of action should one take: give a friendly greeting while walking by or give this man a wide berth avoiding any further contact. A good capture that invokes thought and emotional response in your viewers.', '2015-10-30 09:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413125, 1168845, 43463, '<td valign="top">This slice of life shows a typical workday down in the subway as a man dressed in a business suit looks on at the train pulling away. His stance and expression tell the story of him waiting - as per the title, he waits for the next one. He has missed this one and is slightly annoyed that he will have to wait for the next one to come by.</td>', 'This slice of life shows a typical workday down in the subway as a man dressed in a business suit looks on at the train pulling away. His stance and expression tell the story of him waiting - as per the title, he waits for the next one. He has missed this one and is slightly annoyed that he will have to wait for the next one to come by.', '2015-10-30 09:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413127, 1168846, 43463, '<td valign="top">Interesting take that shows a gathering of people looking at the art on the wall. I like how you composed the shot with the large picture of a woman''s face dominating the left portion and then the next hanging portraits extend off to the background as a diagonal leading line. There is a woman on her phone looking over her shoulder to study the portrait of the woman on the wall. She is giving the photograph ''a look'' as strangely enough the portrait picture stares back at her. I find it equally interesting that all the subjects within your photograph are all woman from what I can see. Woman taking pictures and looking at the portraits of the woman on the wall. Perhaps it is a gallery study and exploration of what is beauty/fame and by what standards does society judges beauty/fame. Looking at the expression of the woman in the forefront of the gallery I get the sense that she is not at all impressed by the picture or that she is apathetic to it.</td>', 'Interesting take that shows a gathering of people looking at the art on the wall. I like how you composed the shot with the large picture of a woman''s face dominating the left portion and then the next hanging portraits extend off to the background as a diagonal leading line. There is a woman on her phone looking over her shoulder to study the portrait of the woman on the wall. She is giving the photograph ''a look'' as strangely enough the portrait picture stares back at her. I find it equally interesting that all the subjects within your photograph are all woman from what I can see. Woman taking pictures and looking at the portraits of the woman on the wall. Perhaps it is a gallery study and exploration of what is beauty/fame and by what standards does society judges beauty/fame. Looking at the expression of the woman in the forefront of the gallery I get the sense that she is not at all impressed by the picture or that she is apathetic to it.', '2015-10-30 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413129, 1168378, 43463, '<td valign="top">I think that this would fit far better as a close-up abstract piece that is an exploration of detail and textures of the common everyday object of a city street. It is an object that one rarely gives a second glance as one walks on, drives by, or cycles past...but it is the groundwork we travel on. There is some wonderful detail here but I think B&amp;W would be a better choice to show the play of light and shadow and the texture detail of the road.</td>', 'I think that this would fit far better as a close-up abstract piece that is an exploration of detail and textures of the common everyday object of a city street. It is an object that one rarely gives a second glance as one walks on, drives by, or cycles past...but it is the groundwork we travel on. There is some wonderful detail here but I think B&W would be a better choice to show the play of light and shadow and the texture detail of the road.', '2015-10-30 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413130, 1168441, 43463, '<td valign="top">Ah, I see what you were capturing to show us! Truly there are only two main subjects we need to be aware of in this shot. The hunched over elderly woman pushing the shopping cart and the woman on the opposite crosswalk pushing the baby stroller - those are the circle or cycle of life that you are showing us. I think this image would have a stronger impact if you crop it to show just those two (three as that there is a baby present) in the ''crosswalks'' of life. The man, the car, and the young woman on the right tend to distract attention away from your main subjects/message. I also think that for this shot full color is distracting and that B&amp;W would draw the eye''s attention more readily to the people in the shot. I do like how you captured the moment showing the elderly woman crossing the road (symbol of life''s path) in the forefront with youth literally and figuratively behind her (the woman pushing the stroller). Also interesting is the juxtaposition of actions here - at each life stage, young and old, they are pushing something.</td>', 'Ah, I see what you were capturing to show us! Truly there are only two main subjects we need to be aware of in this shot. The hunched over elderly woman pushing the shopping cart and the woman on the opposite crosswalk pushing the baby stroller - those are the circle or cycle of life that you are showing us. I think this image would have a stronger impact if you crop it to show just those two (three as that there is a baby present) in the ''crosswalks'' of life. The man, the car, and the young woman on the right tend to distract attention away from your main subjects/message. I also think that for this shot full color is distracting and that B&W would draw the eye''s attention more readily to the people in the shot. I do like how you captured the moment showing the elderly woman crossing the road (symbol of life''s path) in the forefront with youth literally and figuratively behind her (the woman pushing the stroller). Also interesting is the juxtaposition of actions here - at each life stage, young and old, they are pushing something.', '2015-10-30 09:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413131, 1168798, 43463, '<td valign="top">Now, that is an interesting perspective to show people shopping! Not quite the expected street photography but it does show me a different angle/vantage point to people watch as they go about their daily routine of shopping. I do like this take which shows the patterns and movement of people in this store as they move about seeking the items they wish/need to purchase.</td>', 'Now, that is an interesting perspective to show people shopping! Not quite the expected street photography but it does show me a different angle/vantage point to people watch as they go about their daily routine of shopping. I do like this take which shows the patterns and movement of people in this store as they move about seeking the items they wish/need to purchase.', '2015-10-30 09:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413134, 1168674, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow, there is so much interesting things seen and happening here I don''t know where to look first! Now this is definitely an interesting place to take a stroll because of all the wonderful things to look at. But I feel you need to give your audience a main focal point within so that it is a starting point/opening point so the scene is not so overwhelming with busy activity. Just as an example, a picture that shows one or two of the museum patrons with open eyed wonder filling the frame on the left third of the frame looking at the sights would give your audience a starting point to then take in the scene at large.</td>', 'Wow, there is so much interesting things seen and happening here I don''t know where to look first! Now this is definitely an interesting place to take a stroll because of all the wonderful things to look at. But I feel you need to give your audience a main focal point within so that it is a starting point/opening point so the scene is not so overwhelming with busy activity. Just as an example, a picture that shows one or two of the museum patrons with open eyed wonder filling the frame on the left third of the frame looking at the sights would give your audience a starting point to then take in the scene at large.', '2015-10-30 10:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413135, 1168725, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait of Larry with wonderful B&amp;W tones showing off great details and his smiling expression. The busy street fades out in the background with blur and overexposure allowing Larry to really shine and stand out in this photograph. Just a thought, perhaps this could be a stronger street photography shot if more of the city street that he walks in was a tad  more visible - not so much that it becomes distracting but just enough to show your audience the environment he lives in to make a statement that this is Larry, a city dweller.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait of Larry with wonderful B&W tones showing off great details and his smiling expression. The busy street fades out in the background with blur and overexposure allowing Larry to really shine and stand out in this photograph. Just a thought, perhaps this could be a stronger street photography shot if more of the city street that he walks in was a tad  more visible - not so much that it becomes distracting but just enough to show your audience the environment he lives in to make a statement that this is Larry, a city dweller.', '2015-10-30 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
