(7413884, 1168846, 30214, '<td valign="top">I would call it "the lookS", all three of them, counting the girl in the back portrait. Love how they look at each other sequentially, and the last one looks at me!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-11-04 02:59:05.</i></td>', 'I would call it "the lookS", all three of them, counting the girl in the back portrait. Love how they look at each other sequentially, and the last one looks at me!', '2015-11-03 13:45:37.000000', '2015-11-04 02:59:05.000000', 1),
(7413885, 1168774, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice geometry with a perfect man placement! Love how his bent knees echo the stairs. And the work "synchronize" is very dear to my heart: much of my own research in physics is about synchronization! :)<br/> <br/>you get my "yellow virtual book"<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1169319" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169319.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169319.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169319.jpg"/></a></td>', 'nice geometry with a perfect man placement! Love how his bent knees echo the stairs. And the work "synchronize" is very dear to my heart: much of my own research in physics is about synchronization! :) you get my "yellow virtual book"', '2015-11-03 13:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413890, 1168843, 30214, '<td valign="top">excellent timing! Almost perfect symmetry except for the most important subject, right in the middle. Bumping up<br/> <br/>you get a bump and my "red virtual book" award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1169318" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169318.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169318.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169318.jpg"/></a></td>', 'excellent timing! Almost perfect symmetry except for the most important subject, right in the middle. Bumping up you get a bump and my "red virtual book" award', '2015-11-03 13:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413891, 1168760, 30214, '<td valign="top">this is wonderful, light composition, characters, everything is there (even a dog!) for a great street photo. I suspect that one of my books will have to be shipped to Asia (I am guessing Taiwan or Hong Kong :))<br/> <br/>you get a big bump and my "blue virtual book award"<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1169317" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169317.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169317.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169317.jpg"/></a></td>', 'this is wonderful, light composition, characters, everything is there (even a dog!) for a great street photo. I suspect that one of my books will have to be shipped to Asia (I am guessing Taiwan or Hong Kong :)) you get a big bump and my "blue virtual book award"', '2015-11-03 13:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413896, 1168441, 38032, '<td valign="top">a little painful to see. Love the detached characters here. THe barely paying attention pulling of the stroller and cross-like struggle of the pushing of the cart. Excellent captured moment. 8<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png"/></a></td>', 'a little painful to see. Love the detached characters here. THe barely paying attention pulling of the stroller and cross-like struggle of the pushing of the cart. Excellent captured moment. 8', '2015-11-03 15:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
