(7413916, 1168556, 103032, '<td valign="top">My top pick.  Photo captures the guy''s intensity. Seems like he is concentrating on something (is he an artist focusing on his next project... I don''t know, but makes me want to know more about him).<br/> <br/>The drainage/brick line lead us to the other people in the background seemingly going about their business, juxtaposes with the main subject.</td>', 'My top pick.  Photo captures the guy''s intensity. Seems like he is concentrating on something (is he an artist focusing on his next project... I don''t know, but makes me want to know more about him). The drainage/brick line lead us to the other people in the background seemingly going about their business, juxtaposes with the main subject.', '2015-11-03 17:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413917, 1168760, 103032, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks.  Shows the story of two generations doing what they need to do; mom working, daughter working on homework.  At least thats the story I read into it.</td>', 'One of my top picks.  Shows the story of two generations doing what they need to do; mom working, daughter working on homework.  At least thats the story I read into it.', '2015-11-03 17:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413919, 1168725, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like this as a street portrait, but I don''t have context to who he is, why you took a photo of him.  At least in the confines of this challenge.  As such, I gave you a 6.  If this were a portrait challenge, I would have rated it higher.</td>', 'I like this as a street portrait, but I don''t have context to who he is, why you took a photo of him.  At least in the confines of this challenge.  As such, I gave you a 6.  If this were a portrait challenge, I would have rated it higher.', '2015-11-03 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
