(7413924, 1168745, 114285, '<td valign="top">If The boy was running frantically through the birds it would have more impact. Also if the child had a look of extreme joy it definitely would''ve gotten a higher vote from me, as is it looks a bit static. I nearly entered an image like this with a little girl but I thought the same Viewing it  as I do with this one, it just Lacked oomph. Having said that it''s not a bad image,  voted earlier.</td>', 'If The boy was running frantically through the birds it would have more impact. Also if the child had a look of extreme joy it definitely would''ve gotten a higher vote from me, as is it looks a bit static. I nearly entered an image like this with a little girl but I thought the same Viewing it  as I do with this one, it just Lacked oomph. Having said that it''s not a bad image,  voted earlier.', '2015-11-03 18:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
