(7414067, 1168493, 94815, '<td valign="top">I love how random street shots can be so unexpectedly full of surprises beyond the basic framing, textures, tones etc as here with the casual pose of the person eating an apple. Then we notice the open door and disembodied hand. Then notice the "Pen" sign (vs "Open") as obscured by her elbow. Deliberate? Sending a message? We can''t know but I enjoy the mystery these things hint at. bump</td>', 'I love how random street shots can be so unexpectedly full of surprises beyond the basic framing, textures, tones etc as here with the casual pose of the person eating an apple. Then we notice the open door and disembodied hand. Then notice the "Pen" sign (vs "Open") as obscured by her elbow. Deliberate? Sending a message? We can''t know but I enjoy the mystery these things hint at. bump', '2015-11-03 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
