(7414355, 1168846, 69325, '<td valign="top">didn''t vote but as much as I like the picture i probably would have deducted 2 points for the title. I actually made a thread once about the most overused photo titles and this was right at the top of the list. cool shot tho, really pretty girl</td>', 'didn''t vote but as much as I like the picture i probably would have deducted 2 points for the title. I actually made a thread once about the most overused photo titles and this was right at the top of the list. cool shot tho, really pretty girl', '2015-11-04 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 0),
